{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-electric-boot-warmer-sold-via-tiktok-2603-0007","content_id":"51ed66ea-745b-4109-9b15-c42c342e67fe","description":"Product Recall for Electric Boot Warmer presenting a risk of fire. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"2aa29098-37fd-4b86-9a48-f417b931482b","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-04T11:20:09+00:00","id":"2aa29098-37fd-4b86-9a48-f417b931482b","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-04T11:20:09+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a81569622103d52c1a9b7d/2603-0007-product-recall-boot-warmers-sold-via-tiktok.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Electric Boot Warmer sold via TikTok</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as it can overheat during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by TikTok.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electric appliances and equipment – Warming Trays (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>X1</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Listing Name</td>\n      <td>Portable Quick-dry Shoe Dryer, Foldable Design Constant Temperature Shoe Dryer, Household Appliances for Home Use</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>White electric boot warmer.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_2aa29098-37fd-4b86-9a48-f417b931482b\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a81569622103d52c1a9b7d/2603-0007-product-recall-boot-warmers-sold-via-tiktok.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire as it can overheat during use.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by TikTok and removed from the online marketplace.</p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product immediately. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2603-0007</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-04T11:20:49Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-04","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-04T11:20:50+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-electric-boot-warmer-sold-via-tiktok-2603-0007","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-electric-boot-warmer-sold-via-tiktok-2603-0007","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-electric-boot-warmer-sold-via-tiktok-2603-0007","content_id":"51e